Rate Limiter

Functional Requirement
1. Limit the number of request by the user
2. Configurable by the admin
3. whenever the limit exceed give 429.
4. handle burst traffic
5. Support application tier

Non Functional
0. Scale - 1M rps
1. CAP theorem - availability >> consistency ( configurations can slowly apply)
2. Low latency < 5 ms per req

------------------------------------------------------------------

Core entity

1. rateLimitPolicy/rules
2. client
3. requestCounter

