REST APIs

Admin

Create rules : POST   /v1/admin/rules
GET   v1/admin/rules?clientId=xyz
GET   v1/admin/rate-limit/metrics?resource={url}

Response

429
x-rate-limit : 100
x-ratelimit-remaining :
x-ratelimit-reset: 17123456
